For which positive integers $n in ZZ^+$ is the imaginary unit $i$ an $n$-th root of unity (that is, $i^n = 1$)?

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$n = 4 k, quad k in ZZ^+$

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$n = 2 k, quad k in ZZ^+$

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$n = 4 k + 1, quad k in ZZ_(>= 0)$

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$n = 8 k, quad k in ZZ^+$

